      {
        "sha": "7c5b616b4411ab78066c6938985d35acc923f698",
        "message": "Pin updates needed for 24.3 -- compatible with 24.1 (#1511)\n\n- Clean up some DDR pins that aren't arrays.\r\n- Mark unused (commented out) pins VIRTUAL_PIN. Quartus was binding them to\r\n  random locations.\r\n- inout pins can't be virtual (i2c scl/sda). Bind them to physical pins\r\n  on I-series dev kit.\r\n- Note clk_100m and DDR clocks are asynchronous. This ought to be obvious, but\r\n  they share a few nearby I/O buffers, causing timing errors.",
        "date": "2024-08-06T21:08:43Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/OFS/ofs-agx7-pcie-attach/commit/7c5b616b4411ab78066c6938985d35acc923f698"
      },
      {
        "sha": "aa850e7b8f24b58a063ae42c324362e2e94101c8",
        "message": "Add a stub for instantiating the PCIe AXI-S SS instead of DM (#1341)\n\nThere's enough perturbation from the Verilog hierarchy alone to make this\r\na commit of its own. No new features except conditional instantiation of\r\nthe AXI-S stub.",
        "date": "2024-03-15T16:44:24Z",
