      },
      {
        "sha": "2c44a512aeedb2b6540fdd47ebee5323352b42ac",
        "message": "Restructure standard clocks into matched pairs of clk and reset_n.",
        "date": "2020-08-05T20:23:05Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/OFS/ofs-platform-afu-bbb/commit/2c44a512aeedb2b6540fdd47ebee5323352b42ac"
      },
      {
        "sha": "3f98f690afca24255d72fd8d976f6f436142e721",
        "message": "Switch OFS interfaces to active low reset.\n\n- Match new IP, which will be active low.\n- Legacy ccip_std_afu mode remains active high.\n- Define new resets associated with each incoming clock. Platorms may either map\n  these to global wires in the FIM or generate them inside the PR boundary using\n  local logic (usuall in green_bs).",
        "date": "2020-04-13T19:39:12Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/OFS/ofs-platform-afu-bbb/commit/3f98f690afca24255d72fd8d976f6f436142e721"
      },
      {
        "sha": "520eba33da6362e03711a79c73baa603145c4c66",
        "message": "Add \"_fiu\" suffix to base interfaces that cross the PR boundary to make\nit clear which are fixed platform interfaces and which are shimmed AFU\ninterfaces.",
        "date": "2019-10-06T20:57:29Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/OFS/ofs-platform-afu-bbb/commit/520eba33da6362e03711a79c73baa603145c4c66"
      },
      {
        "sha": "03c21e0edb20c71b636e6723844776c52775e395",
        "message": "Generalize the Avalon interface beyond just local memory (#2)\n\n- Add macros for connecting instances of the interface. Tasks would have been better,\r\n  since they are part of the language, but tasks within interfaces aren't stable enough\r\n  across the toolchains.\r\n\r\n- Add waitresponsevalid and response to the core OFS Avalon interface definition.\r\n\r\n- Declare clocks in interfaces as wires.",
        "date": "2019-08-30T17:49:42Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/OFS/ofs-platform-afu-bbb/commit/03c21e0edb20c71b636e6723844776c52775e395"
      },
      {
        "sha": "428c9932cdeac14668d2114f3ed6082292677bc8",
        "message": "Initial implementation of Platform Interface Manager (PIM) v2.\n\n- PIM v2 is compatible with AFU JSON files from PIM v1.\n- PIM v2 adds the ability to describe an AFU's platform interface using only\n  SystemVerilog. More README files and documentation will follow.\n- Updater scripts for BDX, SKX, PAC A10 and PAC S10 releases inject PIM v2 into\n  the standard afu_sim_setup/afu_synth_setup build environment. The public OPAE SDK\n  is required to use the updated releases. The PAC A10 1.2.1 and PAC S10 2.0.1\n  releases will be compatible as well.",
        "date": "2019-08-01T21:23:12Z",
        "html_url": "https://github.com/OFS/ofs-platform-afu-bbb/commit/428c9932cdeac14668d2114f3ed6082292677bc8"
      }
    ],
